// | 256-line cap | PASS | Only over-cap file is tests/fixtures/boundary_257_lines.oo:257 — deliberate boundary fixture probing the cap itself. |
// | Academy header | 105 raw misses → 1 real FAIL | 104 are bootstrap/corpus/{check,emit-c,emit-llvm}/pass|fail/*.oo — minimal compiler test INPUTS (fixtures, not modules; cf. boundary_257). Real violation: qa/scratch_lineno.oo — committed scratch probe, no header, in the qa lane. |
// | Corpus anchoring | GAP | bootstrap/corpus/{check,emit-c,emit-llvm,import,lex,parse,typecheck,differential}/ — no ANCHOR.oo anywhere under corpus/. The fixture exemption is real but undocumented on disk. |
