// | File: truth | **3 drifts** | docs/TOKEN_OPT.oot declares `ooda/docs/…`; docs/CAP_LEGACY_SUPERSEDE_REMOVAL_TODO.oot declares `openOODA/oodac/docs/…` (extra prefix); bootstrap/seed/{README,SIGNING}.oot declare `ooda/bootstrap/…`. Split-era residue. |

// ## 3. Pass-2 — Structure

// 672 .oo files: check/ is the mass center (~2,970 blocks across its
// subtree). emit/{c,llvm}/ are the live backends. bootstrap/{corpus,
// seed}/ + oodac_pure_build = self-host lane. bin/oodac symlink +
// oodac_bin.core present. All 16 ANCHOR.oo are 4-element ALLCAPS.
// qa/ holds the probe suite; qa/suite.oo is NEW (untracked) and
// typechecks on the release binary.

